- Family-relationship-over-Witness priority (the Witness role's own note, and WORKFLOW
  step 4) was added after the user found spouses mislabeled Witness in real GEDCOM
  output and reported family associations (spouse/parent/child) missing entirely -
  NOT YET reviewed against a real re-run since this specific wording was added; the
  Father/Mother/Spouse roles themselves were already confirmed working correctly on at
  least one real family (Margaret Sabiston: Andrew Sabiston correctly tagged Spouse,
  John Falster/Isabella Brown correctly tagged Father/Mother) before this wording change,
